DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       The llllvvmm--ccoovv tool shows code coverage information for programs that are
       instrumented to emit  profile  data.  It  can  be  used  to  work  with
       ggccoovv-style coverage or with ccllaanngg's instrumentation based profiling.

       If  the  program is invoked with a base name of ggccoovv, it will behave as
       if the llllvvmm--ccoovv ggccoovv command were called. Otherwise, a  command  should
       be provided.

